Gatus is a health dashboard that monitors services using HTTP, ICMP,
TCP and DNS queries and evaluates the results against conditions on
the status code, response time, certificate expiration, body and
more. Each check can be paired with alerting via email, ntfy,
Slack, Discord, Telegram and many other providers.

This plugin manages the Gatus service. Endpoints, alerting, storage
and the web listener are configured in /usr/local/etc/gatus.yaml.

WWW: https://gatus.io
